I have combined the monitor mode patch from the Shmoo group and the
scanning patch from Moustafa A. Youssef
<http://www.cs.umd.edu/%7Emoustafa/morinoco/morinoco.html>  (see
http://www.hpl.hp.com/personal/Jean_Tourrilhes/Linux/Orinoco.html#drivers
for those patches) and a patch for the airport card from
http://www.swieskowski.net/code/wifi.php together.  Now my iBook2 with
an airport card can scan and monitor, which makes me happy.  Thanks to
those who wrote the patches.

The patch is at http://home.attbi.com/~minyard if you are interested.

